<title>SINGAPORE: Cycle &amp; Carriage 1st-half net up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Cycle &amp; Carriage 1st-half net up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			96.0   vs   84.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 9.0   vs    8.0</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	   41.1   vs   36.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			 984.7   vs 1031.1</p>
<p>    Associates (group share)   615.1   vs  443.6</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 0.7   vs    2.3</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		  153.1   vs  130.4</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)	     13.9   vs    7.9</p>
<p>    Retained profits		80.4   vs   70.7</p>
<p>    Div pay/Div register	Sept 30/Sept 16</p>
<p>NOTE: Cycle &amp; Carriage Ltd is a  diversified vehicle distributorship with interests in property.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
